    narr:narration """This position holds that [the hero video is a human moment, not a screen recording](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_15), grounded in the working rule [don't make people read text in a video](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_14). The claim generalizes an earlier observation — [Tina's \"it just looks real\" applied to video, not just GIFs](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_18) — into [the human moment sells, not the text](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_18). A concrete [five-beat format](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_16) sketches the arc from real conversation through cited output to the expert's reaction. The position is reinforced by [Freya's reaction to the demo walkthrough](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_8), relayed through the assistant's rendering rather than voiced directly here.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_14> ;
